{"_meta": {"name": "crma_synthetic_v1", "synthetic": true, "provenance": "25 hand-written claim-repudiation scenarios (invented insurers, policies, amounts). Gold labels reflect the team's reading of the IRDAI Master Circular (29 May 2024) 5-year moratorium and general claims-settlement principles, assigned BEFORE running BimaNyay; they are NOT legal advice and NOT verified by a lawyer or IRDAI. Several scenarios are deliberately ones the category-driven engine cannot get right (the reason text decides the outcome, or the category string is out of contract).", "description": "Scenario -> expected (is_wrongful, cited ground, clinical-review flag). expected_clause is a case-insensitive substring that must appear in a returned violation's statute/clause text, or null (no specific citation required)."}}
